Hey Clayton,

Can you share some plots of the covariates?  Histograms and maps?  If they aren't standardized and/or scaled well enough, that could be a problem.

The density model can be sensitive to the structure of the covariates and the amount of data (spatial recaptures, trapping extent, etc.).

Also, based on your trimS value it looks like you are working in meters.  Might be good to rescale to km.

